  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UTP: Skills4Recovery (GIZ) 2025-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focuses on enhancing the institutional capacity of vocational training providers to deliver labour market-relevant training that meets the needs of both the recovery phase and target groups, including youth, women, internally displaced persons (IDPs), ex-combatants, and people with disabilities. It also aims to provide fast-track, medium-, and long-term vocational training that aligns with current labour demands and supports transitions into the labour market.</narrative>
  </description>
